  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans 6569, 2731-SK-15  and\r\n2731-LE-609A submitted respectively on 2 July 2010, 15 October 2010 and 27 October 2010,  therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 3 - The use hereby permitted shall be discontinued on or before 26th September 2013.",
    "Condition : 4 - Travel PlanPrior to the implementation of the temporary consent hereby permitted, a travel plan shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the local planning authority. The travel plan, as submitted, shall follow the current 'Travel Plan Development Control Guidance' issued by TfL and will include:(1) Targets for sustainable travel arrangements (e.g. as noted above: the plan will secure a 10% reduction in those ariving at the site as a driver from the modal split estimated within the TA.)(2) Effective measures for the ongoing monitoring of the travel plan (i.e.the procurement of appropriate third party monitoring OR through signing up to the Enterprise Travel Plan Scheme)(3) A commitment to delivering the travel plan objectives for the of consent from first occupation of the development(4) Effective mechanisms to achieve the objectives of the travel plan by both present and future occupiers of the developmentThe development shall be implemented only in accordance with the approved travel plan.",
    "Condition : 5 - Notwithstanding the details shown on the floor plan submitted the sill of first floor window herby approved shall overhang the adjoining land. ReasonSo as not to prejudice the development potential of the adjoining land."
